  "overview": "Hendersonville NC PD uses Flock Safety technology to capture objective evidence without compromising on individual privacy. Hendersonville NC PD utilizes retroactive search to solve crimes after they've occurred. Additionally, Hendersonville NC PD utilizes real time alerting of hotlist vehicles to capture wanted criminals. In an effort to ensure proper usage and guardrails are in place, they have made the below policies and usage statistics available to the public.\n\nCommunity Impact\nIn the North Carolina News\nLINCOLNTON, NC\n5/17/2026\n\nRETAIL THEFT / SHOPLIFTING\n\nFlock LPR Helps Identify Two Larceny Suspects in Lincolnton, NC\nVIDEO\nRead full story\nROCKINGHAM, NC\n5/15/2026\n\nSTOLEN VEHICLE RECOVERY\n\nFlock LPR Alert Leads to Stolen Motorcycle Recovery in Rockingham, NC\nLPR\nRead full story\nGASTONIA, NC\n5/10/2026\n\nSTOLEN VEHICLE RECOVERY\n\nFlock LPR Alert Leads to Two Arrests After Stolen Motorcycle Chase in Gastonia\nLPR\nRead full story\nHUNTERSVILLE, NC\n5/1/2026\n\nHIT-AND-RUN\n\nFlock LPR Alert Leads to Arrest After Stolen Vehicle Pursuit in Huntersville\nLPR\nRead full story\nBURLINGTON, NC\n4/22/2026\n\nMISSING PERSON\n\nFlock LPR Helps Locate Missing Person Across State Lines in NC\nLPR\nRead full story\nData & Usage Summary\nCamera Alert Activity\n\nCamera alerts by source and topic over the last 30 days.\n\n392 alerts\nNCIC - Protection Order\n209\nNCIC - Stolen Plate\n105\nNCIC - Stolen Vehicle\n58\nNCIC - Sex Offender\n11\nNCIC - Missing Person\n4\nNCIC - Warrants\n3\nNCIC - Violent Person\n2",
